window.products.push({"id":1020061,"name":"Nipichsha Coasters for Drinks, Set of 6 Marble Absorbent Ceramic Coasters with Holder & Cork Base, Cute Stone Drink Coasters for Cup Kitchen Home Deco","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71knkePrYHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Personalized Coasters Set】Set contains 6 pieces round ceramics coasters with size 4 x 4 x 0.3 inch, and a black metal coasters holder. These cute coasters has a slight stone touch, comes with vibrant color and beautiful design, goes with everthing. Match perfectly with all style home, kitchen, living room, bar, hotel, restaurants. 【Super Absorbent Coasters】Specialized absorbent ceramics can absorb all condensation, spilled coffee and cola stains in 10-15 seconds. The ceramic drink coasters provide more absorbent than other coaster made of all-cork, leather, paper, cardboard, rubber. Use these absorbent coasters as coffee coasters, wine coasters, or tea coasters to keep your tables, desks, counters, and trays clean and dry. 【Non-slip Cork Base】Used cork for base to enhance the friction and protect tabletop from scratches. Nipichsha coasters for drinks can firmly grip the desktop but won’t scratch your tables and other surfaces. Fits all type of table incuding wood, glass, marble, metal and more. You can use the cork coasters on your dining table, coffee table or even for at the office. 【Great Gift Idea】Pretty coasters will delight everyone. Great warming presents for new home, coffee accessories, table decor, home decor, lake house decor. These luxury marble coasters for drinks will make them smile! Great gift idea for girls, coworkers, Moms, Birthday, Valentine's Day, Easter Day, Mother's Day, Labor Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving Day and Christmas. 【Easy to Care and Store】 Black metal holder included to let you can organize coaster. Makes coasters look beautiful and better organized. The stone coasters features great locking-color effect, will not fade or bleed after repeated cleaning. Easy to clean the coasters with warm soapy water if absorb dark colored liquids such as coffee and red wine. Allow to air dry completely between uses and before storing in holder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71knkePrYHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nipichsha","source_asin":"B0BVR22GF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVR22GF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVR22GF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
