window.products.push({"id":1020244,"name":"Portable Blender, Blender for Shakes and Smoothies, Personal Blender, Mini Hand Blender, One-handed Small Juicer Machines with Rechargeable Usb, Blend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kAH+JQsFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍓【Rechargeable and Portable Blender】🍎Unique one-handed drinking personal blender for shakes and smoothies. The built-in 2400mAh USB rechargeable battery can be charged by power bank, computer, car power or other USB power sources. It can be fully charged by about 3 hours and blender bottle can use up to 15 times. 350ml capacity only 1.32 lb product weight and the portable blender with an ANTI-SLIP LANYARD make it easy to take out to the office, traveling, camping, outdoor or chilling at home. 🥑【Powerful 4 Stainless Blades 】🥝The smoothie blender is equipped with 4 pieces 304 stainless steel blades with 7.4 rated voltage. With the strong blades lifting and pushing down quickly, immersion blender only takes 40 seconds （twice shakes）to bring you a cup of fresh smoothie, protein shakes, fresh juices, baby food etc. Evenly cut and delicate taste.The juice made by the mini blender bottle is smooth and delicate, without residue and graininess, you will get satisfacted in every drink. 🍅【Upgrade Magnetic Contact Charging】🍒The hand blender for shakes and smoothies has strong magnetic adsorption charging, only need to suck gently. Stable current output and fast charging. The blender bottles USB joint is stronger, more durable, soft, lightweight and easy to store. 🍇【Safe Material & Smart System】🍈Personal portable blender is BPA Free. The blender bottles cup body is composed of two layers, the inner material is TRITAN (baby bottle grade) and the outer material is ABS. The smoothie blender embraces unique safety design including safety indication light, MAGNETIC INDUCTION DESIGN ( Juicer machines will only work when the blender bottle is locked properly ) and silicone charging port protection that protect your safety while making delicious juice. 🍋【Easy Operation & One Button Control】🍉The mini blender is easy to use, just Press and Hold the Power Button for 2 Seconds, the juicer blender starts to work, the green light is on, and smoothie blender stops automatically after 20 seconds. Rinse with water after use. For safety concern, Juicing while charging is prohibited and not soak the whole juicer in water for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51kAH+JQsFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAEYONK","source_asin":"B0B1PDMYF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020244","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1PDMYF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1PDMYF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
