window.products.push({"id":1020361,"name":"Bamboo Pillow Cases Set of 2 - Cooling Pillowcase 2 Pack with Envelope Closure, Cool Chill & Breathable Pillow Case (20\"X26\"-Pillowcase(2pc),Blush)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CFViLFReL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【What's in the set?:】 Pillowcase each set contains two standard pillowcases 20 by 26 inches.Pillowcase in envelope style so that you can hold your pillow inside easily. 【Why Bamboo?】The silky soft fabric can help with reducing hair breakage,preventing split ends;The naturally cooling character of bamboo fabric wick away moisture and keep skin dry.The fabric has bamboo-kun can help you away from allergies skin suffering. 【What room style it fit?】: Plain dyed design, simple and elegant color, hotel stitching style,our solid sheet set can be integrated into all kinds of home style.Best for any room in your house - bedroom, guest room, kids room, RV, vacation home.Take you a simple but luxury bed room scene. 【What quality will you get?】With a 300 thread count sateen weaving, the superior quality of these bamboo viscose sheets are a dream to sleep on, getting softer with every wash. The 16\" extra deep pocket fitted sheet will fit most of mattresses.Fine stitching takes you more safe using experience.The beautiful self bag packaging makes it classic as a gift to give out. 【Satisfactory sales service】：We are so confident in the quality of our product that we offer 90 days return and replacement service. We also provide it with a life time free customer service. If you find that our products have quality problems, just contact us and we will solve the problem for you immediately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51CFViLFReL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENDLESS WARMTH","source_asin":"B09X2WNR6T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X2WNR6T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X2WNR6T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020362,"name":"Sanus BFAV550-CH1 Shelf Audio/Video Stand Chocolate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414txAT5pgL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Sanus basic Series Bfav550 audio video stand is expertly crafted for high performance and superior value. Its painted glass shelves and unique waterfall design bring an elegant look to any decor. This solid piece Features generous cable management channels and adjustable feet for easy leveling on any surface. Open architecture allows unrestricted airflow, keeping AV components at the proper temperature for Optimal performance. The Bfav550 is compatible with the FM's for a TV pillar-mounted solution. Available in Chestnut or Chocolate finish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414txAT5pgL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sanus","source_asin":"B003WU4MTA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003WU4MTA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003WU4MTA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020363,"name":"Zinus Memory Foam 13 Inch Memory Foam Mattress with Double Layer Airflow Foam, Cal King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gag74PltL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the cool comfort and memory foam support of the Sleep Master Memory Foam 13 Inch Mattress from Zinus, pioneers in comfort innovation. This mattress provides conforming comfort with foam layers that mold to the natural shape of your body. The cool support of the Airflow High-density Foam base layers provide long lasting durability and stability. The Sleep Master Memory Foam 13 Inch Mattress provides the perfect balance of support and comfort to ensure that you get a refreshing night's sleep. Please open your mattress package within 72 hours of receipt and allow 48 hours for your new mattress to return to its original, plush shape. Worry free 10 year limited warranty. Another comfort innovation from Zinus. Pioneering comfort.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gag74PltL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sleep Master","source_asin":"B006LLXYIW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006LLXYIW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B006LLXYIW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020364,"name":"Hokand Digital Alarm Clock for Bedroom - 7\" Large LED Display with USB Charger,Backup Battery,Indoor Temperature,Humidity,Day,18 Melodies,5 Brightness","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PE4d59SIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Music Bedside Alarm Clock with Type-C USB and Backup Battery - It can be powered by USB C charger or only by backup battery.With USB-C charger cable,charging is more convenient and faster.An extra Type-A USB Output Port was design for charging your mobile phone,pad or smart watch,etc.The led digital clock work well for bedroom,office or living room decor. Mirror Digital Clock with Indoor Temperature and Humidity - Help you use the air conditioner or humidifier or dehumidifier more reasonably and help you create a comfortable indoor living environment.(Tips:When charging, the temperature will be slightly higher and will return to normal after charging is completed.) Dual Alarms with 18 Melodies and Volume Control - With 1 Min Ring and 5 Min Snooze plus 4-level volume,it is enough to wake up every one even heavy sleepers.This digital clock is also available to set the Working Day You Need.Alarm Ringtone including elegant classical music, natural bird sounds, and traditional beep ringtones, which can meet the needs of different people. 5-level Adjustable Brightness Display with Sound Control - When Sound Control function is turned on, LCD display will automatically become the darkest and light up only when you make a 60db sound or touch the clock lightly.If you want it to Stay Light Up,just turn off sound control,and it is recommended to power the clock with USB. Easy to Read and Easy to Use - Ergonomic Design and Time Memory,Large Time Digital Display ,Day, 12/24Hr format,℉/℃ temp units switch plus a HD LED screen,you can easy to read all the information you need. The high-quality ABS material combined with the excellent ergonomically designed shape makes it very comfortable to touch and operate.With time memory function,you do not need to reset the clock after power failure. Manually Daylight Saving Time - DST starts in the early morning of the second Sunday in March and ends in the early morning of the first Sunday in November each year . If you need to use DST, just turn on and off the DST button on these two days each year without resetting the time. What You Get - Clock(Size:L:6.6x2.6x1.4in),type-C to type-A USB Charger Cable, instruction manual,worry-free 366-day warranty,friendly customer service.It would be a very good choice to give it as a gift to your family, friends or yourself.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PE4d59SIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hokand","source_asin":"B09MHBXL1M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MHBXL1M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MHBXL1M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
