window.products.push({"id":1020481,"name":"VTI BL Series TV Stand-Silver/Black/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":502.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HpoemMQJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This contemporary TV stand is designed to accommodate all kinds of equipment, with a stackable structure that can be added to as needed. The heavy gauge steel frame is available in a choice of finishes. This entertainment center is sure to impress for a long time to come.Features :- TV stand frame is constructed of heavy gauge steel- TV stand shelves are made of MDF with wood grain laminate- Frame and shelves come in a choice of finishes and colors- All poles are sand/lead fillable- Accommodates up to most 50\" LCD / Plasma TV and four Audio / Video components- Additional shelf can added up to four shelves- Ready to assemble- Approx. overall dimensions: 23.8\" H x 44.25\" W x 20\" L- Spacing between shelves: 9\" and 7\"- TV stand capacity (without any added shelves): 400 lbs.Specifications :- Product Dimensions : 23\"H x 42.5\"W x 20.33\"D- Product Weight : 76 lbs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61HpoemMQJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VTI","source_asin":"B003UXB3LE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003UXB3LE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003UXB3LE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020482,"name":"Granite Ware Clam and Lobster Steamer with Faucet Set, 19-Quart, 3-Piece, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+2eadQrlL._AC_.jpg","description":"Whether it's steaming seafood, lobster boil or a shore dinner, Granite Ware specialty seafood pots are unique, multi-functional and perfect for the job. Made in the USA, the large capacity of the 19-Quart Clam and Lobster Steamer is designed to accommodate large gatherings and produce outstanding results. The faucet helps drain off steamy liquids without getting burned. Porcelain is fused to the steel at 2,000 degrees Fahrenheit producing a non-porous, inert glass surface that is naturally non-stick. The powder melts and flows and hardens to a durable vitreous coating on a carbon steel core. It creates a smooth, hard finish that won’t burn and resists staining. It’s also non -porous so it won’t trap odors or food particles and provides a low coefficient of friction – meaning that it cleans up easily and, it is corrosion and chemically resistant so it will last a long time. When fired, the vessel is placed on pins so the bottom and sides are hardened during the firing process into one smooth laminated glass surface. You may notice slight pin indentations where the glass has flowed around the pin that supports the base during firing. The pin marks do not compromise the finish or performance of the vessel. Porcelain can chip if dropped, however this does not reduce the effectiveness of the cookware. Not recommended for glass cooktops.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+2eadQrlL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Columbian Home","source_asin":"B0000BYDKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000BYDKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000BYDKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020483,"name":"JUVITUS Amber 4 oz Glass Packer Bottle with Black Ribbed Lid (12 pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R5o0JjazL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MEASUREMENTS - Height: - 3.83\" / Diameter: - 2.00\". 12 PACK of 4 oz Amber Glass Packer Bottles with a Black Ribbed Lid. TRUE AMBER UV PROTECTION: Dark true amber glass round bottles protects your photosensitive products from UV rays and have a larger neck size for easy pouring and filling. FOAM LINED LIDS: These containers have a 38-400 lid size that includes a foam liner to create a nice airtight seal. A perfect container for storing varies capsules along with many herbs and spices.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71R5o0JjazL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUVITUS","source_asin":"B07WW9JQ17","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020483","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WW9JQ17","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WW9JQ17","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020484,"name":"Luau Life Hawaiian Grass Table Skirt with Hibiscus Flower Trim, Plastic Clips Included for Extra Support, Perfect Luau Themed Decorations for Tiki Bar","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MbH2F3GkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Aloha add some tropical island flavor to your party table or tiki bar with our lovely luau life grass table skirts our gorgeous faux grass table skirt features festive green or natural colored strands of 28\" tall grass and beautiful fabric hibiscus flowers that never wilt looking to have a tropical island getaway in your backyard or tiki bar? Our table skirt can be used to decorate a standard-size banquet table or smaller. This is a must-have decoration for any luau themed or summer birthday party match one of our grass skirts with the rest of your tropical or island-themed tableware if you want to add some spice with a pineapple centerpiece or decorative fruit platters. Simply drape our lovely skirt around your table for an instant touch of the tropics perfect for summer luau parties, birthdays, greek-life celebrations, bars, barmitzvahs, quinceañeras, baby showers, bachelor and bachelorette parties, and more setup: Our table skirt doesn't use sticky and messy adhesives that wear out, instead we've included four (4) strong plastic universal table clips that you can easily slide on and off of any size of table our near-invisible plastic clips are strong enough to protect your display from breezes, mischievous pets, and other elements that might threaten your celebration. They are soft enough not to scratch the table once removed later, unlike metal clips used by top competitors. The skirts are created using durable materials that won't wear with time or liquid exposure. Reusable, simple, fast, efficient. Use our fantastic table skirt again and again with ease mahalo.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91MbH2F3GkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luau Life","source_asin":"B076GBXWMC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020484","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076GBXWMC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076GBXWMC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
