window.products.push({"id":1020513,"name":"Valentines Day Decor, DECSPAS 3-layered Pink Red Heart Wood Block Set Valentines Day Decoration, Happy Valentine's Day Sign Valentines Day Decorations","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x+-Olm92L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💝【Valentines Day Decor】- DECSPAS valentines day decoration features two rectangular blocks in colors of pink and red spelling “Happy Valentine’s Day” and three adorable hearts ornaments with festive words. Raised design makes these valentines decorations more textured. Add a layer of sophistication and character to a space without overpowering. With tenderhearted affection wafting through the air, finish up your home with this indoor valentines day decor to express your burning love! 💝【Create Romantic Atmosphere】 - Red represents passion and evokes excitement. Pink is the color most often associated with charm, tenderness, sweetness and romance. Equipped with classic seasonal color combinations, ingenious 3D surface shaping and timely words, these valentines day decorations for the home easily get you in just the right mood for valentine. When time comes to the day full of love, harness romantic fervor and affectionate cravings with this aesthetic accent! 💝【Multiple Uses】 - This valentines decor is in large size measuring 7 x 6 x 1.4 inches. Whether in traditional or trendy decoration style, DECSPAS valentine decor could fit well. Perfect addition to your home, living room, dining table, office, window sill, bedroom, fireplace, shelf, kitchen, cafe, restaurant, entryway, etc. Wonderful embellishments for Valentine’s Day, Anniversary, Wedding, Spring. Display these valentine decorations on the welcome corner to impress your guests in no time! 💝【Perfect Gift】 -  We all wish to see a smile of love on the face of our beloved. A wonderful gift can definitely surprise the beloved. DECSPAS valentines day decoration with Valentine’s Day themed characters are amazing as presents to send to your darling, lover, sweetheart, friends, family to deliver happy mood and express your love. Distinctive appearance would speak volumes of your taste in art and insert energy into everyone’s heart. Be sure to delight people year after year! 💝【Superior Materials】 -  This valentines day decor is made of solid MDF material, no odor, thick, non-broken and safe to use. Careful polish creates smooth surface without burrs. Superior printing technique keeps this lovely mantel decor away from fading. Excellent craftsmanship gives this valentines day decoration durability and extends its service life. Whether you host a hangout with close friends or someone extra special, these valentines decorations will surely have everybody swooning! 💝【100% Satisfaction Customer Service】 - If you have any question, please feel free to contact us, we provide 90 days warranty and 24/7 online support customer service. If for any reason, you are not 100% satisfied with our products, we will issue you a full refund or a replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61x+-Olm92L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECSPAS","source_asin":"B0BGRG3X2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020513","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGRG3X2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGRG3X2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
