window.products.push({"id":1020542,"name":"Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless - Hand Free Countertop Soap Dispensers with Infrared Induction, Waterproof Sanitizer Dispenser, Suitable for Home, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vAURkmOWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Why choose Automatic Foam Soap Dispenser? This automatic soap dispenser touchless will depense soap foam instead of soap liquid.You don't need to touch soap, or press soap pump, get rich foam by a wave easily. New Way to Clean - More Hygienic Don’t have to touch the pump to use soap. Avoid the risk of germs that might be on the surface of the dispenser. IPX4 Waterproof Ideally suitable for various scenes like Kitchen Sink, Bathroom, Coffee bar, Hotel, Restaurant, Office etc. Smart Infrared Motion Sensor Create foam directly, more convenient and easy to wash hands. Just obtain soap by gently extending your hands, reduce the amount of soap used by 50%. Time and Water Saving To use liquid soap with this dispenser, you have to dilute the soap with water in a ratio of 1: 4, stir until it dissolved with water. Packing Included: Automatic Soap Dispenser *1 User Manual * 1 Specifications: Color: White Material: ABS plastic Capacity: 320ml/10.9oz Sensor Range: 0-6cm/0-2.36in Dispensing Volume: 1.8-4ml/0.06-0.136oz Power Supply: 4x AAA batteries (Packing NOT included) Product Dimensions: 8.5 x 4 x 3 inches Warm tip: 1.If the Automatic Soap Dispenser doesn't foam, but light flashing. Please check soap outlet and pipe, make sure nothing clog them. Then fill the soap reservoir with water and wave hand to get water out. It will test soap passage and also help to clean the passage. If it doesn't work, please contact the seller. 2.If you choose thick liquid soap, please add 3-8 times of water for dilution before using it. 3.If you choose foaming hand soap, please do not add water to mix. 4.If you add too much water, please pour more the thick liquid soap, then mix it to ensure that the extracted soap is a foam-rich.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vAURkmOWL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sec","source_asin":"B088T8KXDW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020542","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088T8KXDW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088T8KXDW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
