window.products.push({"id":1020576,"name":"Wind Talk Electric Wine Stoppers, Automatic Wine Saver Wine Bottle Stopper with Vacuum Pump, Best Wine Gifts, with Food-Grade Silicone, keep Wine Fres","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zQvdwLhLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"AUTOMATIC WINE STOPPERS: this electronic wine stoppers are easy to run with 2 x AAA batteries(no included). Insert the wine stopper into the bottle neck firmly, while the sensor switch is triggered, the blue indicator light up and starts to work and draw vacuum. After pumping the air out of the bottle, the blue indicator light will turned off. With 2 LED indicator light, it is easy to know the battery power and vacuuming status in real time. INTELLIGENT DETECTION SYSTEM: the intelligent wine bottle stoppers will automatically detect the air pressure inside the bottle constantly, it will restart air pumping when negative pressure leakage reaches -0.01MPa, which keep an airtight vacuum all the time.With tip-over detection system, if the bottle is tilted over 45°,the electric wine corks will stop pumping and the vacuuming indicator fresh in red,avoid liquid flow into the wine saver.After resotred the bottle, the air pumping auto resume PORTABLE & COMPACT DESIGN: this wine vacuum stopper preserver with a portable design 2.8 x 2.8 x 1.9 inches, can totally grab in your hand, cordless design also makes it easier to carry and store. A great solution to store wine for household, club, bar, hotel, or family and friends gatherings, and even take it out for a picnic SAFE FOOD-GRADE MATERIAL: the electric wine stopper Sealer is made from high quality food-grade Silicone and ABS material, which guarantees safety and hygiene. Suitable for wine bottles with an bottleneck inner diameter of 0.7-0.77inch( not fit for screw top bottles, sparking bottles and Champane bottles). Keep the sealed wine bottle in a wine cabinet or refrigerator for better preserving effect, and recommend to finish the wine in 7 days CUSTOMER SERVICE: CE, RoHs certificated. You have 18 months manufacture warranty on every new products","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zQvdwLhLL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wind Talk","source_asin":"B08S39T8WH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020576","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08S39T8WH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08S39T8WH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
