window.products.push({"id":1020608,"name":"TOPULORS Multipurpose 5 pcs Fireplace Accessories Tools Sets - Poker, Shovel, Tongs & Brush Durable Wrought Iron Tool Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gCMrGwGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-Quality Materials: The fireplace set tools are solid and made with sturdy wrought iron, with a powder-coated finish that further enhances their durability, ensuring they will last for years to come. Multi-Purpose Tools: Our fireplace tool sets include a poker, shovel, and brush, each fireplace tool has a firm handle, feels good in the hand that providing all the necessary tools to tend to your fire and keep your hearth clean.r easy identification. Stylish Design: Our fireplace tools feature elegant and classic designs that can complement any décor style, making them not only functional but also aesthetically pleasing.Fireplace tool set that decorates you home and also functions perfectly around the fireplace! Easy to Use: Our fireplace tools have long handles, allowing you to safely and comfortably manage your fire from a distance, and the ergonomic handles ensure a comfortable grip. Great Gift: Our fireplace tool sets make great gifts for homeowners, newlyweds, and anyone who enjoys cozy nights by the fire. They come packaged in an attractive box, making them easy to wrap and give as a thoughtful present.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gCMrGwGPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TOPULORS","source_asin":"B01NCRPXXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020608","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NCRPXXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NCRPXXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020609,"name":"2 Pack True HEPA KILO Filter, 360° 3-Stage Filtration, Compatible with Afloia KILO/KILOPRO/MIRO and MIRO PRO Air purifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fuj7aL-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT FIT: This kilo replacement filter is only compatible with Afloia Air Purifier KILO, Morento Air Purifier Kilo, KILO/KILO PRO/ MIRO and MIRO PRO Air Purifier. (The product model can be confirmed at the bottom of the machine.) ASIN:B08PCXJVFH/B0948XR4DC/B096RQBXJP/B08YT4TNJD/B088FJ8YBJ/B096RQBXJP. ATTENTION: NOT FIT for ASLotus, Sans, Fillo, Allo, Halo, COLIN, MAX, MAGE, MAGE PRO. Please check your model of air purifier before placing the order. EASY TO REPLACE: It is recommended to replace the compatible afloia air purifier filter replacement every 3-6 months according to your living air quality. Install simply and fits snugly, no tools are required, ensuring you replace your old filter in minutes. After replacing, please press the power button for 7s to reset the machine, life counter of the filter will start and the light will stop blinking. 3-IN-1 FILTRATION: Our KILO air purifier filter is made of 4 layers. Fine Preliminary Filter effectively collects dust, hair, pet danders, pollen, and other large particles of pollutants; H13 True HEPA Filter can effectively attach on up to 99.97% of particles as small as 0.3 microns; Activated Carbon Filter can effectively take in air odors caused by cooking, pets, smoking, etc., to achieve rapid deodorization effect. WARM TIPS: Please take off the plastic packaging from the new compatible afloia filter before use. After replacing the filter, turn on the machine and keep pressing the power button 7s until the blinking red light disappears. VALUA PACKAGE: Included 2 compatible afloia true hepa 13 filters. The dimensions are 6.5”x 6.5”x 8.58”. If you meet any problems during using time, please feel free to contact us through our Amazon home page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81fuj7aL-nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ShufudeJa","source_asin":"B0C65F87FF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020609","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C65F87FF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C65F87FF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
