window.products.push({"id":1020730,"name":"King Electric EFW2440 4000W 240V Large Economy Wall Heater","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Mu1GhHVWL._SL1200_.jpg","description":"King EFW2440 4000W 240V Large Economy Wall Heater The combination of low cost, high power and durability make the King EFW2440 4000W 240V Large Economy Wall Heater a fantastic choice for apartments and other similar spaces. The EFW is designed for a recessed installation and includes a recessed wall can with ground wire to ensure a fast setup. Long life lubrication on bearings and high quality components are used to keep the unit low maintenance for both tenants and landlords while safety features help to prevent any accidents and allow for peace of mind during usage. Ideal for apartments - covers 400 square feet With 4000 watts of power, this heater can provide adequate coverage for an area of up to 400 square feet. The EFW's high wattage options and low cost make them the ideal choice for heating apartments and other similar spaces. They're built to last and have safety mechanisms in place to save both tenants and landlords trouble with accidents or maintenance. Overheat protection Safety features are an important consideration when installing new heating units into your home. The EFW series features a built-in overheat protection feature which automatically powers down the heating element and motor if normal operating temperatures are exceeded, so you don't need to worry about any damage or accidents during usage. The unit will automatically reset once temperatures have returned to normal. A light illuminates when the cutout trips and turns off on reset. It lets you enjoy your heat without stressing over poor design choices and safety concerns. Steel recessed can The EFW is designed for a recessed wall installation and comes with a 20 gauge electrogalvanized steel recess can. The can has factory installed ground wire which is approved for direct contact with building insulation. Installation and setup is a simple and pain free process. Steel recessed can Great for apartments Durable and long lasting 240 volts, 4000 watts Covers up to 400 square feet Built.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Mu1GhHVWL._SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KING ELECTRIC","source_asin":"B000VZM3WW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VZM3WW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VZM3WW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
