window.products.push({"id":1020737,"name":"Factory-Reconditioned Saeco V'spresso Super-Automatic Espresso Machine, Dark Graphite","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41htSV1EZHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Combining advanced technology with ease of use, this super-automatic espresso machine automatically grinds the right amount of coffee, tamps, brews, and dispenses used grounds into an internal dregdrawer, all at the push of a button. The machine's built-in conical burr grinder offers 18 different grind settings, from fine to course, while its Opti-Dose system makes it easy to adjust the amount of ground coffee from 6 to 9 grams per brewing cycle, affecting the strength of the espresso from mild to strong. The unit also provides a pre-ground bypass doser for using pre-ground decaffeinated or flavored coffee without having to empty the beans in the grinder--great for entertaining. Its Saeco Aroma System injects a small amount of hot water into freshly ground coffee right before the brewing process to help maximize flavor extraction. Even more, Rapid Steam technology reduces the normal waiting time between brewing coffee and steam output to just a few seconds. Use the steam and hot-water wand to froth milk for cappuccinos and lattes, or to dispense hot water for Americanos, tea, hot chocolate, and other drinks. The unit's dual-spout dispensing head can be raised or lowered according to the cup size, easily accommodating 4-ounce espresso cups or 8-ounce coffee mugs. For added convenience, the machine's LCD display allows for operating the automatic rinsing cycle; the water-hardness test; the brew-temperature settings to maximum, high, medium, low, or minimum; 10 language options; an automatic descaling cycle; the energy-saving timer; and the total servings counter. Other highlights include a 68-ounce removable water tank, an Aqua Prima water filter, 15-bar pump pressure, three programmable beverage-volume brew buttons, a Bon Temp cup-warming surface, and a slide-out drip tray, as well as a removable brew group for easy rinsing and chemical-free cleaning, and a swivel base for convenient accessibility to all the components. Accessories include a cleaning brush, a pre-ground bypass doser scoop, a brew-group key, an Aqua Prima water filter and applicator, a water-test strip, a priming pump, and an instructional manual. The 1250-watt espresso machine measures 16 by 11 by 14-1/2 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty. Editor's note: This is a reconditioned small appliance. Reconditioned generally means that the appliance has been returned to the manufacturer, who returns the appliance to like-new condition. Some appliances may contain cosmetic blemishes.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41htSV1EZHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saeco","source_asin":"B000ZH4YGE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020737","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ZH4YGE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ZH4YGE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
