window.products.push({"id":1020747,"name":"MANIFICTOUCH Lime Basil & Citrus Fragrance - Reed Diffuser Essential Oil with Rattan Flowers , Reed Diffuser Set, Oil & Sticks Reed Diffusers, Home, B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vJkWdOxTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"The ManificTouch , Lime, Basil & Citrus fragrance Reed Diffuser is a modern style room fresheners in a decorative bottle made with of natural plant essential oils & organic solution which will last for a long time. Scent your space with a rich and sweet smell that is perfectly balanced to make a pleasant impression and provide a beautiful experience to your friends, family, and guests. ManificTouch Reed diffuser will infuse your home with natural goodness making it an ideal gift or something special for your own home. To use : Remove the cork from the bottle and immerse reeds into the oil. Flip stick reeds when necessary for a burst of a stronger scent. The reeds are designed to gently release the fragrance slowly and evenly into the air. The fragrance comes with 2 reed sticks and 3 sola flower reeds. The flower petals absorb the essential oil and release the fragrance slowly. Tip #1 : Place in the right spot. Airflow or the movement of your surroundings helps circulate the fragrance, creating the ideal fragrance. Keep your reed diffuser out of pets, children and anything that might cause it to spill over. Tip #2: Flip the stick reeds. Fiber reeds are designed to wick the scented oils from the bottle to the air, releasing the fragrance you want. Flipping them regularly and you’ll have the scent at its freshest and most fragrant. Tip #3: Adjust scent intensity. To either increase or decrease the fragrance level, simply add or remove the number of reeds placed in your vessel. Keep in mind the more reeds you flip and the more often you flip them, the faster the fragrance oil will evaporate. Tip #4: Be Careful. Use caution when flipping the reeds. Flip the reeds over a wastebasket or sink. Use a coaster or plate under your diffuser to keep any oil drips from damaging a counter top. Better Reed Diffuser, Better Life","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51vJkWdOxTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ManificTouch","source_asin":"B08YD7SM7Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020747","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YD7SM7Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YD7SM7Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
