window.products.push({"id":1020756,"name":"Spiral Candle Sticks - Handmade 10 Inches Dripless Taper Candle Twisted Candle for Dinner Wedding & Home Decor Set of 2 (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611l5ihJo8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🕯️【Characteristic】-These spiral taper candle measure approximately 10 inches, they are cute and small, and they don't take up too much space, they can add glamour to your room, with a wave-like shape like Earth and sea vacation mood, adding simplicity and elegance to the room. 🕯️【Creativity】-Our candlesticks is inspired by Greek Goddess Hestia and Roman Goddess Vesta, they are known as goddesses of the hearth, home, and family. Their symbol was fire and it represented the center of the home. We have joined them together to create Vestia Candles and represent the fire in our candles that we hope will bring warmth, love, and peace to your home. 🕯️【Material】-We know how important clean and environmentally friendly ingredients are so we Spiral Candles are made of high-quality paraffin, not only bright color but also for a dripless and unscrented. 🕯️【Making Way】-Each candle sticks bulk is unique and due to its handmade nature, some minor variations may occur. There could be some wax frosting or small bubbles to see on the surface but these don't affect the quality of the twisted candle sticks. I do my best to \"minimize\" those superficial details but can't assure you perfection with handmade candles 🕯️【Health & Safety】-To prevent fire and serious injury, burn tapered candle within sight. Keep away from drafts and vibrations. Keep out of reach of children and pets. Never burn candle on or near anything that can catch fire. We recommend trimming your candles wick to around 5mm before lighting it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611l5ihJo8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XINAOBAOLUO","source_asin":"B0BM3X96VG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM3X96VG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM3X96VG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
