window.products.push({"id":1020762,"name":"The Bradford Exchange Thomas Kinkade Faith Crystalline Butterfly Sculpture","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FsnpFai3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Bradford Exchange Exclusive Showcasing These Fine Features: Glittering faceted butterfly design captures the luminous sparkle of crystal. Luminous silverplating on the delicate, faux-jewelled antennae enhances this sparkling butterfly, graced with Thomas Kinkade’s award-winning garden artwork Beloved words from Scripture convey an uplifting message in golden lettering Hand-numbered limited edition includes a Certificate of Authenticity> A brilliant celebration of nature and the beauty of faith, the first-ever Thomas Kinkade “Gardens of Paradise” Crystalline Butterfly is only available from The Bradford Exchange. Measures 6 in. L x 4¼ in. W. Includes upright display stand on back. The Garden of Prayer 1997 Thomas Kinkade 2015 BGE","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FsnpFai3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Bradford Exchange","source_asin":"B0141P5EHS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020762","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0141P5EHS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0141P5EHS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020763,"name":"KitchenAid DRTVICE5 (FGA+RVSA+FVSP) Stand Mixer Attachment Pack Food Grinder/Fruit Vegetable Strainer/Rotor Slicer Shredder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MabTSWQmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Grind, strain, slice and shred. The KitchenAid food grinder helps you grind raw meat for fresh burgers, while the fruit and vegetable strainer turns unpeeled apple slices into smooth applesauce in minutes. Plus, the rotor slicer/shredder makes quick work of shredding cheeses and slicing a variety of fruits and vegetables. For everything you want to make. KitchenAid.This assortment of attachments makes your KitchenAid stand mixer as flexible as a Swiss army knife. You get a food grinder, slicer/shredder, and the fruit/vegetable strainer. Pull out the first and you're grinding meat, breadcrumbs, and more; the second churns out sliced vegetables for potato chips, coleslaw, and the like, or shredded potatoes for hash browns; and the third has you whipping up apple butter in a snap. Each has its own instruction booklet, with tips and recipes. An excellent gift set for your favorite stand-mixer fan.The food grinder helps you grind raw meat for fresh burgers, while the fruit and vegetable strainer turns unpeeled apple slices into smooth applesauce in minutes. Plus, the rotor slicer/shredder makes quick work of shredding cheeses.Fruit/Vegetable Strainer Works with the food grinder to help you quickly and easily grind and strain the peels from fresh fruits and vegetables for tomato sauce, fruit butters, baby food and more. Rotor Slicer/Shredder Makes unbelievably quick work of shredding cheeses for pasta or pizza, slicing vegetables for stir fry, shredding carrots and cabbage for slaw and much more.Food Grinder Offers the utmost versatility, with coarse and fine grinding plates to help you make dishes like salsa, fresh ground meat for burgers, bread crumbs and more quickly and easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51MabTSWQmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B07VM53JX1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020763","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VM53JX1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VM53JX1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
