window.products.push({"id":1020877,"name":"1pc Larimar Small A-grade Tumbled Natural Healing Crystal Gemstone Rubbing Stone from Dominican Republic Also Known as Dolphin or Atlantis Stone.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+jickFLZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Larimar was originally discovered in 1916 by a Spanish priest who reported the discovery but no mining was done. Then, in 1974, the American Peace Corps Volunteer, Norman Rilling, and the Dominican, Miguel Mendez, rediscovered the stone on the beaches of Barahona. It was determined by geologists that Larimar is a rare form of Blue Pectolite. Named for Mr. Mendez’s daughter “Larissa” and the Spanish word for sea “Mar”, Larimar contains the blue hues of the Caribbean Sea, with white and gray 'clouds'. It is a stunning stone. Some believe that Larimar is the blue stone with extraordinary healing powers that Edgar Cayce predicted would be discovered in the Caribbean, where he said part of Atlantis could be found. Larimar awakens feminine power and soothes the emotions & is especially excellent for pregnant or new mothers to relieve depression and stress. It assists in expression of emotions, teaches respect, love, and nurturing, & cleanses unhealthy emotional blocks, and it also releases attachments. Created by volcanic activity, it balances water and fire energy. It is a powerful throat chakra stone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+jickFLZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FVLFIL","source_asin":"B08XBR54QD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020877","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XBR54QD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XBR54QD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020878,"name":"Welland Adjustable 3 Tiers Dish Drying Rack, Utensil Drying Rack, Large Dish Drainer, Chrome","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YAudw4YDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Air-drying dishes instead of using bacteria-laden towels is the safest way to handle them--ask any health department. Using a dish rack also provides an alternative to risking delicate dishes and glassware to the rigors of a dishwasher and to wasting a dishwasher cycle to wash just a few items. The trick is to find a dish rack that's attractive enough to leave on the counter and that won't become covered in soap scum as plastic racks often do. This rack from Welland meets these criteria ---- it¡¯s three-tiered design allows you to dry more dishes in the same amount of counter space. Sturdy design with high quality chrome finish; Freely add-on structure and adjusting each shelf's height as you like; Heavy duty loading capacities; Easy assemble and dismantle, no tools required; Sleek and chic carbon steel turns this utilitarian item into an art object, well, almost! The dish rack is ideal for apartments, office, dorms, RVs and other small areas. Dishes drain quickly in this compact draining rack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YAudw4YDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WELLAND","source_asin":"B005K479XM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020878","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005K479XM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B005K479XM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
