window.products.push({"id":1020974,"name":"AIDLGPPCP Headboard Pillow Triangular Headboard Wedge Bed Rest Reading Pillow Backrest Positioning Support Bolster Cushion with Removable Cover 39 X 2","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":80.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mid0R2pxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Easy Good Back Support Wedge pillow:The Decorative back pillow can corrects sitting posture and provides excellent back & neck Support,Product size is 39 X 20 X 8 in [L*H*D],Product wedge pillow packaging forThis is vacuum sealed,bed bolsters and cushions will be wrinkled when received, but don't worry, just tap the product a few times and the product will return to its original shape,Or leave it for a while and it also returns to its original state. Triangular headboard pillow Design: The wedge shape of the back pillow can perfectly match the natural curvature of the human. Whether sitting or lying down, this decorative throw pillow can offers a comfortable support in any position thanks to its wedge shape. High Quality Material: The bed wedge pillow is stuffed with high-density polyurethane filler ensure long-term use and not easy to deform， The high-quality velvet fabric of the back support body pillow touches very soft, durable and not easy to pilling. Multipurpose bed wedge : The decorative Bolster pillow for bed is great for home use for bed and sofa,also can be used on hospital, hotel, daybed, window seat, couch, even a party, or anywhere you like. This bed wedge pillow for headboard helps you relax and comfortably while reading, watching TV, playing video games or even night time online shopping, large wedge pillow is also special holiday gift for all ages and occasions. NOTE: The wedge head restraint is shipped in a vacuum package. In order to prevent the connection line between the two keys from breaking due to the pressure generated by vacuum compression, we consider lengthening the connection line between the keys. When you receive the product, it doesn't look as good as the picture. You just shorten the distance between the buttons and shoot the product and it will return to its original shape","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Mid0R2pxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AIDLGPPCP","source_asin":"B0BCPQD1BG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCPQD1BG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCPQD1BG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1020975,"name":"Platinum Pure - Large Reusable Sous Vide Bags - Set of 2 BPA Free Bags for Sous Vide Cooking - 100% Pure LFGB Platinum Silicone with no Fillers - Comp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HgQPRCmCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"NOT ALL SILICONE IS CREATED EQUAL: 100% Platinum Pure LFGB silicone with No FILLERS – Surpasses minimums, the silicone in our sous vide bags is certified to the much more stringent European LFGB standards. Our platinum pure curing process ensures there are no by-products, BPA, BPS, PVC, or Phthalates. Our silicone bags are completely odorless and will not affect food odor or flavor. THE ORIGINAL SILICONE SOUS VIDE BAG: Extra-large capacity and extra wide mouth is designed specifically for Sous Vide cooking. The 100% silicone bag is perfect for sous vide cooking - fish, steaks, vegetables, roasts, pork shoulder, multiple chicken breasts or steaks. THIN DESIGN FOR SUPERIOR COOKING: Silicone bag provides heat exchange and superior air displacement (no vacuum sealer needed). This superior method offers even heating compared to other bags with zipper-like seals. REUSABLE: Designed for hundreds of uses and washes. No tough to clean corners makes washing easy. Dishwasher safe. Works with all Immersion Circulators including Instant Pot, Joule, Anova, ChefSteps, Kitchen Gizmo, Gramercy Kitchen, Gourmia, and more These bags use the water displacement method and therefore are not meant to be sealed. Step 1: Fill the silicone bag with desired food, do not seal. Step 2: Slowly lower into water, allow air to escape and vacuum to form around contents. Step 3: Keep opening above water and secure bag to side of container with enclosed fastener or clips. Optional: Use enclosed silicone fastener through top bag hole as needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51HgQPRCmCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Platinum Pure","source_asin":"B07GCV788C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1020975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GCV788C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GCV788C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
